{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_15_level_main_15-14_end",
  "groupId": "main_15",
  "stageId": "main_15-14",
  "title": "拒绝哀悼",
  "storyCode": "15-15",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_15-14_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "dd25fdff25e5938a0752c770a37bcaddf9a9c74d7a145f106ada6309a950a250",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "text": "目标已经消灭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "text": "Stormeye，四点钟方向，两击连射。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "text": "对着墙体支柱？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Stormeye虽然很疑惑，但依旧毫不犹豫地连续射出了两箭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "text": "地形在我出手的瞬间发生了变化，障碍物刚好消失，命中敌方......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "text": "可露希尔，你怎么做到的？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "text": "嘿嘿，不是我，是ZOOT算出来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "text": "现在，六点钟方向，直接跳下去。别害怕空洞下面的源石晶簇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "text": "哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他直直飞跃而下，地形再次变化。他开始了永无止境的下坠，直到咒言编织的绳索拉住了他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "text": "可露希尔算得很准。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "text": "我已在此等候多时。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "text": "现在呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "text": "聆听指引，闭目前行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "text": "可视范围内所有敌对目标，成功摧毁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "text": "隔离区防线已建立。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_017_huang_1",
      "text": "干得漂亮，小猫！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_017_huang_1",
      "text": "唔，就是没有给我留几个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_017_huang_1",
      "text": "可露希尔，接下来怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "text": "倒计时三十秒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "text": "下一波敌人会在你们正前方出现，全力清除。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "text": "那里会开启通往博士必经之路的新通道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_017_huang_1",
      "text": "好！那可以让罪魁祸首再狠狠心疼一波了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_017_huang_1",
      "text": "小猫，这次让我先动手如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "text": "没用！可露希尔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "text": "周围的建筑结构开始收缩了，它们试图挤压我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "text": "放出去的无人机也无法找到任何可行的路径，加固设备也撑不了太久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "text": "在算了！在算了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "text": "ZOOT正在同时处理很庞大的信息，给她一点时间！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "text": "6，5，4，3，2......1！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "text": "Mechanist，抬头！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "text": "......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阴影中的天花板开始扭曲，一道泛着寒光的刀锋划出了一条通往未知的道路。\n随后一只手从中伸了出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "有人说你需要搭把手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "时间紧迫，只好用些非常手段了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "抓紧了，Mechanist！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "大伙都在等你呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "text": "（愤怒的嘶吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "text": "（咆哮）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "text": "（积蓄能量）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "text": "（释放炙热的光束）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "激射而出的光束在把源石结晶体围拢成的包围圈撕裂开一个巨大的口子后，继续向着远处扫射过去......击倒了越来越多的源石结晶体——\n但突然，它被某种力量挡住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "力道不错嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_017_huang_1",
      "text": "但小心别伤到博士，Mon3tr。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "text": "我们已就位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你带领着众人从黑暗中走了出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "凯尔希就在这。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": "npc_10002",
          "text": "（欢快地抖擞身体）"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "支援Mon3tr。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "净空石棺周围的敌人。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿斯卡纶",
          "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
          "text": "随时策应我。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Misery",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
          "text": "放心。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
          "text": "咒言随行。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
          "text": "那......就是石棺？就一直被隐藏在本舰内？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我初次醒来的地方......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希尔",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
          "text": "ZOOT识别到凯尔希的信号在减弱！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希尔",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
          "text": "必须尽快确认。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Touch",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_249_1",
          "text": "凯尔希在里面？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Touch",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_249_1",
          "text": "按照Raidian的说法来看，她的状态可不怎么乐观。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1730_1",
          "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，我们需要尽快让她离开那里。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1730_1",
          "text": "再拖延下去，我担心......她的安全。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pith",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1310_1",
          "text": "不能妄动，我们并不清楚凯尔希与石棺的情况。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pith",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1310_1",
          "text": "根据当初的作战纪录，在切尔诺伯格时也有人接触了石棺，最后却产生了我们都没预料到的变故。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "凯尔希不一样。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "交给我。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "掩护我。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你毫不迟疑地向石棺走去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你触碰到了冰冷的石棺，它......在回应你。\n不，是凯尔希在回应你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "接下来我们还得一起继续向前呢。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "凯尔希医生，你——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "虚弱的声音",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......你们来得很及时。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "虚弱的声音",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "罗德岛......怎么样了......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你向石棺中的人伸出了手。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "大家都还平安。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "多亏你的努力。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "欢迎回来，凯尔希。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "她拉住了你的手，你能感觉到她前所未有地脆弱。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你看上去不是很好。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "刚刚发生了什么事？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "不必在意我......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "借助石棺介入PRTS很困难，但意料之外的是，我收到了一份礼物。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "关于PRTS和普瑞赛斯的更多情报，我会马上共享给你们。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": "npc_10002",
          "text": "（紧张的嘶吼）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "不用害怕，Mon3tr。我还站在你面前。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "我不会抛下你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，我已经找到了通往Abyss的路。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "这场混乱该结束了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "这里受到的干扰很强，我们已经极为靠近Abyss。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "但这里没有路了，Abyss彻底把自己隐藏起来了——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "在这个距离内，我可以清楚地判断出它的位置。"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "凯尔希站在最深处的墙壁之前，深深地吸了一口气。\n她从未走到如此深入的地方——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": "npc_10002",
          "text": "（焦虑的低鸣）"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "别担心，Mon3tr。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我会陪着她。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你走到了凯尔希的身边。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "我也在，凯尔希医生。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "罗德岛会共同面对威胁。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "......这次的结果，也许的确会不一样。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "我通过石棺保留了部分权限，我来打开一条通路。"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "凯尔希触碰到了那堵隔绝了你们与Abyss的墙。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希尔",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1723_1",
          "text": "“零号油罐”......谢谢你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希尔",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1723_1",
          "text": "本舰也终于停下了。"
