        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": "npc_10002",
          "text": "（信任的低吼）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "阿米娅，时刻注意Dr.{@nickname}的状态。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "一旦我们进入Abyss，我们对于现实的一切认知都有可能受到冲击。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "危险随时会发生，但你和博士的安危永远是最高优先级。那个最终的威胁，只有你们才能应对。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "嗯......我会小心。"
