        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "有其他需要我注意的事情吗？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "相信你的本心即可。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，我并未预想到这种局面到来得如此迅速。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "但在内化宇宙和特里蒙的经历让我重新思考了许多，你已经让我看到了另一种可能。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "接下来发生的任何事情，对你，对我，对罗德岛的所有人而言，都是未知数。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "所以，Dr.{@nickname}，我需要你告诉我——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "你是否还对可能面对的危险有任何的迟疑？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
